attention of scouts, he is now desperate to do whatever it takes to prove himself. Yataro is prepared to get his hands dirty if it means winning. If it means standing at the top! Welcome to the world of international football! Nothing is sacred, no rule is left unbroken! Not when victory is on the line!","year":2022,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Psychological","Sports"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/be35df55-adc2-46e6-83cf-0e9f0356ea39/0e356023-c480-4fb2-8cdb-b25419675181.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["vi","ru","en","pt-br","fr","es-la"],"lane":"manga","rating":9.02,"follows":1890,"listAt":"2026-10-23T04:02:06.769Z","chapters":[{"id":"7e3d61d8-3ef2-455a-9e7d-ce5fcec006a3","number":"1","volume":"1","title":"All of myself(1)","lang":"en","pages":56,"createdAt":"2023-03-21T19:46:07+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:30:12.028Z"},"c6afc15c-889e-4d8a-8282-1f99dd650c24":{"id":"c6afc15c-889e-4d8a-8282-1f99dd650c24","title":"Sonyeo Baduk","altTitle":"Girl's Baduk","description":"Di atas papan Go seluas lautan atau bintang-bintang, seorang gadis bertekad bulat kembali ke permainan untuk merebut kembali sesuatu yang berharga yang telah hilang. Bersama seorang laki-laki pendiam yang memiliki kerinduan tak terucap yang sama, setiap batu yang ditempatkan menguji ingatan, tekad, dan skill. Sebuah kisah kedewasaan yang lembut namun kompetitif, di mana setiap langkah membuka jalan baru ke depan.","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Psychological","Romance","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/c6afc15c-889e-4d8a-8282-1f99dd650c24/22936074-1b31-47d5-9112-aa4e8e8fe199.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["id","fr","pt-br","pl"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.85,"follows":1197,"listAt":"2026-10-23T04:02:20.590Z","chapters":[{"id":"f76bd3d3-3d3c-4dbe-9025-9f2e8aa8e9ea","number":"4